# Throwaway measurement scripts. Balance work constantly needs one-off harness runs
# (parameter sweeps, A/B grids, diagnostics); they are scaffolding for a decision, not
# tests anyone should keep. Name them tests/_*.test.ts so `npm test` still picks them up
# while they exist and git never does.
tests/_*.test.ts
